@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@
+# (99,66) delta=5/2 stage-8 kill gate
+
+Status: SKELETON
+
+Inputs: frozen lane `/tmp/jc2-lane.MvSYEH/inputs`; checksum manifest generated from `xmodel/g9966-delta52-kill-gate-gpt55-20260903.run.v2`.
+
+## 1. Custody and replay
+
+TODO.
+
+## 2. Stage-8 pivots and residue
+
+TODO.
