+
+The variable/ring map is stated: field `Q`, Q-star pivots only on nonzero
+rational coefficients, lexicographic symbol order, and `c` or `rho` excluded
+from pivots.  Matching names are not used as proof of a coordinate map; the
+K2c inverse is typed by the unit-triangular ledger.
+
+No prime-labelled object is treated as a derivative without declaration.
+The derivative in the ODE discussion is the branch variable derivative.
+
+No exit-price assertion is introduced, so no `charge_basis` line is emitted.
+No `REPRESENTATIVE`, `FULL_ACTUAL_EXIT`, `KELLER` witness, or recomposed
+counterexample is claimed.
+
