@@ -0,0 +1,491 @@
+# Hostile gate: delta=5/2 stage-8 kill for the (99,66) joint chart
+
+Date: 2026-09-04 UTC.  Computation artifacts were generated from the
+September 3 lane inputs under `box/g9966d52gate-20260903/`.
+
+## Verdict
+
+`CONFIRMED[DELTA52-STAGE8-DECLARED-NECESSARY-FINITE-CHART-KILL]`.
+
+The charged stage-7 endpoint was replayed mechanically: exact localized
+dimension `869`, outer D2 rank `5598`, outer D1 rank `176`, joint Q-star rank
+`59`, and zero residue.  The pinned stage-8 system was then rerun in the
+foreground with `timeout 3000` and CPU affinity `0,1,2,3`.  It exited `0`;
+the validated stage-8 ledger is `DEAD`.
+
+The seven new Q-star pivots are exactly the Jacobian degree-155 rows
+`k=35..41` on `B1c_7_19..B1c_7_25`, with coefficients
+
+```text
+675, 576, 477, 378, 279, 180, 81.
+```
+
+After all 66 cumulative rational pivots, the only reduced residue is
+
+```text
+stage8_G_local16_coord0 = 64.
+```
+
+Since the coefficient field is `Q`, this gives the explicit membership
+certificate
+
+```text
+1 = (1/64) * stage8_G_local16_coord0.
+```
+
+The raw residue ideal is already `[1]`; localizing at `c != 0` cannot restore
+a point.  An independent characteristic-zero Singular replay of the emitted
+Rabinowitsch script returned dimension `-1`, standard basis `1`, and controls
+`0,1,0`.
+
+Together with the charged delta-2 stage-4 unit row
+`stage4_J_d159_k35 = 6264`, independently replayed here with the same
+Singular controls, both declared split branches are empty inside the declared
+joint chart.
+
+## Custody
+
+The 23 charged inputs in `/tmp/jc2-lane.MvSYEH/inputs` were checked before
+any replay.  The manifest was generated mechanically from
+`xmodel/g9966-delta52-kill-gate-gpt55-20260903.run.v2`, pairing each indexed
+`charged_input_<i>_sha256` with the corresponding
+`charged_input_<i>_basename`; `sha256sum -c` returned `OK` for every input.
+No digest was manually retyped.  The resulting gate manifest is
+`box/g9966d52gate-20260903/charged-inputs.sha256`, SHA-256
+`fad58e40a54625eef336ca634c18568db08769bdfd6872c8ad8c2005954fba63`.
+
+The pinned continuation engine is
+`box/g9966band-20260903/band_engine.py`, SHA-256
+`3bd2937d75d59d59edeca1b89eba286fd2711f2d608109e7fd8971b64e059ac9`.  Its
+transitive frozen view is the earlier Sol input lane
+`/tmp/jc2-lane.cNPqDa/inputs`; the gate driver restored and verified that
+view from `xmodel/g9966-global-band-sol56-20260903.run.v2`, without changing
+the engine.
+
+The stage-7 endpoint custody replay confirmed:
+
+```text
+stage7.json bytes      43433
+stage7.json SHA-256    a85d602dc4599c600c12b04e2c3140f00dafafbb5793b3b05039050cba6159b3
+dimension              869
+residue_count          0
+dimension formula      6702 - 5598 - 176 - 59 = 869
+```
+
+The regenerated stage-8 next-system manifest is byte-identical to the charged
+one:
+
+```text
+next-stage8-system.json SHA-256
+a050af8c5d4bbb703babb2ce2ee57a70c411eb801226ac9f5cdcffbfa0bfa699
+```
+
+It carries the accepted stage-7 path/hash, the 869 unresolved generator names,
