+No digest was manually retyped.  The resulting gate manifest is
+`box/g9966d52gate-20260903/charged-inputs.sha256`, SHA-256
+`fad58e40a54625eef336ca634c18568db08769bdfd6872c8ad8c2005954fba63`.
